      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not that i want to \"fix\" it. i dont think i can. it feels like the season has passed me by, you know? like everything that mattered or had meaning is just... gone. i'm just an old song playing in an empty room. there's no point in trying to find a place in a world that doesn't even speak my language anymore. it's just so quiet and lonely.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
